      "text": "📋 Phase 1: 需求釐清 (Requirement Clarification)\n此階段由 [plan agent] 主導，透過對話釐清 user 真正想做什麼。\n⚡ 推理任務不需要本地檔案，可透過 Zero-Token Gateway 呼叫 DeepSeek/ChatGPT/Gemini 節省 token",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "a1",
      "originalText": "📋 Phase 1: 需求釐清 (Requirement Clarification)\n此階段由 [plan agent] 主導，透過對話釐清 user 真正想做什麼。\n⚡ 推理任務不需要本地檔案，可透過 Zero-Token Gateway 呼叫 DeepSeek/ChatGPT/Gemini 節省 token",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
