      "text": "📋 Phase 5: 進度追蹤 (Progress Tracking)\n每個子任務完成後更新 roadmap.md。當所有子任務完成，整個開發流程結束。\n📁 目錄結構：docs/trly/{主任務}/ ├── roadmap.md ├── {子任務A}.md └── {子任務B}.md",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "a5",
      "originalText": "📋 Phase 5: 進度追蹤 (Progress Tracking)\n每個子任務完成後更新 roadmap.md。當所有子任務完成，整個開發流程結束。\n📁 目錄結構：docs/trly/{主任務}/ ├── roadmap.md ├── {子任務A}.md └── {子任務B}.md",
      "autoResize": true,
