      "originalText": "🏗️ 需要先建立的基礎設施：\n1. LangGraph StateGraph 框架 (node / edge / conditional edge / checkpoint)\n2. Zero-Token Gateway adapter  3. Skill 入口 (/rtly:dev) + CLI 入口 (rtly dev)\n4. Roadmap manager (讀寫 roadmap.md 的模組)  5. LangSmith / LangFuse tracing 設定",
